<section class="page-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="section-subtitle"><%- icon('stethoscope') %> How It Works</span>
    <h1>Your Path To Lasting Relief</h1>
    <p>A clear, compassionate process from your first visit to long-term wellness.</p>
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> / <span>How It Works</span>
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="process-head">
      <h2 class="display-3">Comprehensive Chiropractic, One Step At A Time</h2>
      <p class="lead">We combine detailed assessment, personalized treatment, and ongoing support so you can move better and feel stronger.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step" data-reveal data-delay="1">
        <div class="num">1</div>
        <h3>Consultation & Assessment</h3>
        <p>Your first visit begins with a conversation. We listen to your symptoms, review your health history, and perform a thorough physical exam. This may include posture analysis, range-of-motion testing, orthopedic tests, and digital imaging referrals when necessary.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step" data-reveal data-delay="2">
        <div class="num">2</div>
        <h3>Personalized Care Plan</h3>
        <p>Based on your assessment, we design a plan tailored to your goals. Treatments may include chiropractic adjustments, soft-tissue therapy, spinal decompression, corrective exercises, and lifestyle recommendations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step" data-reveal data-delay="3">
        <div class="num">3</div>
        <h3>Lasting Relief & Wellness</h3>
        <p>As your symptoms improve, we shift focus to prevention. You'll receive home exercises, ergonomic tips, and periodic progress checks to keep your spine healthy for the long run.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-content">
        <span class="section-subtitle"><%- icon('award') %> What Makes Us Different</span>
        <h2>Patient-Centered Care That Puts You First</h2>
        <p class="lead">No rushed appointments. No cookie-cutter plans. At SpineVita, every patient receives one-on-one attention from a doctor invested in their recovery.</p>
        <ul class="benefits-list">
          <li>Transparent pricing and treatment timelines</li>
          <li>Coordination with insurance and accident claims</li>
          <li>Same-week appointment availability</li>
          <li>Compassionate, judgment-free environment</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Start Your Journey <span class="arw"><%- icon('arrow-right','ico-xs') %></span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="about-image">
        <img src="/images/about.webp" alt="SpineVita chiropractic clinic" width="600" height="520" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
